    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what does that even mean... \"stop fighting the darkness\"? it just sounds like you're saying there's no point in trying to be okay anymore. like, if i stop fighting, i'm just... giving in. is that what you're saying is the only way? to just stop trying to exist against it?",
